    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14826" root="رجح" body-key="r">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رجّح هٰذَا عَلَى ذَاكَ</span></b>  <i>He made this to outweigh that.</i> (MA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رجّح الشَّىْءَ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>He</i>

<i>held,</i> or <i>pronounced,</i> [and <i>it made,</i>] <i>the thing</i> [<i>to
outweigh,</i> as meaning] <i>to be more,</i> or <i>most, excel-lent</i> or <i>preferable,</i> and <i>of more,</i> or <i>most, force</i> or
<i>validity.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also 4. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And see 5.

